   "source": [
    "## Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook demonstrates the complete macro trading ML pipeline:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Data Ingestion** - Apify for macro calendar, Tavily for news\n",
    "2. **Feature Engineering** - Surprises, rolling stats, lags, sentiment, time features\n",
    "3. **Macro Summary** - Automated 1-page outlook with themes, risks, trading ideas\n",
    "4. **ML Modeling** - Walk-forward validation with multiple models\n",
    "5. **Visualization** - Interactive Plotly charts + static Matplotlib reports\n",
    "6. **Persistence** - SQLite database, CSV exports, model serialization\n",
    "\n",
    "All components are modular and can be run independently or as a full pipeline."
   ]
